# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): the level cap alone either side of 95 (a GM's setLevelCap). A level 91 Warrior,
# Prelude to Puissance completed, the Limit Breaker held, MAX_LEVEL 99: cap 94 and cap 96: no section (no other limit
# break of the moogle answers: Dormant Powers Dislodged is not completed, Prelude to Puissance is): the default 10045
# (0, 0, 2, 0); cap 95: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 94
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
keyitem LimitBreaker
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 94: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 96                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 96: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 95                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 95: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
